  "about": "Riven's own biomes (biomes-registry-v2). Every column reports one riven: biome, chosen from its habitat key: inland keys by climate region and calm elevation (lowland for LOW and MID, highland for HIGH), rugged keys by temperature band (hills for LOW and MID, peaks for HIGH), coast and water keys and river mouths by name. Underground, cells report the depth biomes and realms of riven-realms.json. Each biome extends the vanilla class of its kind (parent), which shader packs and other mods read as its category; temperature, rainfall and precipitation drive vanilla weather; underground (void-parent) biomes spawn only the vanilla mobs of their spawn table. Decoration and surface still come from each column's legacy look until Riven's feature families replace them.",
